  "goodToKnow": "Die Bevölkerungsgruppe is a population group or section of society: ethnische Bevölkerungsgruppen, besonders gefährdete Bevölkerungsgruppen (vulnerable groups). Germany recognises four national minorities: Danes, Frisians, Sorbs, and German Sinti and Roma. §130 of the criminal code (Volksverhetzung) bans incitement to hatred against parts of the population. Plural: die Bevölkerungsgruppen."
